msgid "Seeing the technologies shaping the future up close was truly inspiring. The scale, the energy, the sheer density of innovation — MWC reminded us exactly why we do what we do at G‑Fenix."
msgstr "Die Technologien aus nächster Nähe zu sehen war wirklich inspirierend. MWC hat uns daran erinnert, warum wir tun, was wir tun."

